    "text": "\u00c6rest \u00e6t gorgrafes sl\u00e6de on \u00f0\u00e6t crundel.\nOf \u00f0am crundelle on l\u00e6ces ford, on \u00f0one mor.\nOf \u00f0ane forda on ceobban hangran.\nOf \u00f0an hangran on \u00f0\u00e6t w\u00e6tersl\u00e6d.\nOf \u00f0an w\u00e6tersl\u00e6de on sceobban oran wylle.\nOf sceobban oran wylle on wrohthangran.\nOf wrohthangran on cybban stan.\nOf \u00f0an stane on \u00f0one hrycgweg.\nAndlang weges on Colmenoran.\nOf Colmenoran on w\u00e6ndles cumb.\nOf \u00f0an cumbe on \u00f0one swanweg.\nOf \u00f0an wege on riscleahe ufewearde.\nOf riscleahe on \u00f0one rugan weg.\nOf \u00f0am wege on \u00f0one lampyt.\nOf \u00f0am pytte on \u00f0\u00e6s cumbes heafod.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6s cumbes heafde on \u00f0one portweg, o\u00f0 \u00f0one greatan \u00feorn.\nOf \u00f0an \u00feorne on foxhola cumbe ofeweardne.\nOf \u00f0an cumbe to blacan graue, ofeweardan on \u00f0a dic.\nAndlang dic to heorthamme.\nOf heorthamme to Wudaforda.\nOf Wudaforda on Pottenes treow.\nOf \u00f0an treowe andlang gem\u00e6res on \u00f0one mor.\n\u00d0\u00e6t up andlang broces on cealdan wyl.\nOf cealdan wylle to \u00f0\u00e6re \u00feornrawe.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6re \u00feornrawe \u00f0\u00e6t eft in on gorgrafes sl\u00e6d.",
